- **OpenSpec**: `openspec/specs/<area>/<capability>/spec.md` = current behaviour (Requirement + `#### Scenario:`); `openspec/changes/<id>/` = work in flight (`proposal.md`, `design.md`, `tasks.md`, delta specs). `/opsx:explore` → `/opsx:propose` → `/opsx:apply` → `/opsx:archive`, and **archiving is not optional**: it merges the deltas into the specs. `.claude/commands/opsx/**` and `.claude/skills/openspec-*/**` are generated, never hand-edited. → `docs/conventions/openspec-workflow.md`
